<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan May wholesale prices at 13.84 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan May wholesale prices at 13.84 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's wholesale price index rose 13.83 percent in May year-on-year compared tO 13.21 percent in April, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The index, using 1990/91 as base year, fell 0.35 percent to 208.61 from 207.88 in April. The index stood at 183.27 in May 1996.</p>
<p>					  May	April	  May 1996</p>
<p>WHOLESALE PRICES base 1990/91   208.61   207.88	 183.27</p>
<p>    Month-on-month		  +0.35    +1.48	    n/a</p>
<p>    Year-on-year		   +13.83   +13.21	    n/a</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom 9251-274757</p>
